Subject: [PATCH] sigma-dut: MAP R6 support

- Add support for EasyMesh R6 cert cases.
- Add new MSG and TLV definitions for EasyMesh R6.
- Add handlings for MLO related configurations.
- Set 6G radio default channel to 37.

